  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：中际旭创2Q26营收超预期，800G与1.6T放量</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS最新一期中际旭创（300502.SZ）业绩点评，核心判断很直接：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营收和利润都超出预期，且增长不是靠价格，而是靠高速光模块出货结构升级。报告将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>盈利预测分别上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，理由是800G和1.6T产品放量、产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>以及芯片供给改善。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。2Q26单季营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">125.72亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51%</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">97%</span>，比GS自己的预测高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，比市场一致预期高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>。净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47.55亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">101%</span>，环比增长71%，落在公司此前指引42亿至62亿元区间内。毛利率48.0%，略低于一季度的49.2%，但净利率37.8%反而高于一季度的33.3%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份报告最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的不是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>本身，而是它对下半年的判断：GS预计3Q26和4Q26营收分别为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">160.83亿元</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">174.38亿元</span>，意味着下半年环比继续<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>。支撑这个判断的，是资产负债表上的两个信号。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWA9l6jiavGvRjtOiclk6QiaH5qpc41BialOibl4Nzj7s9C7iaLGFc7tPReicO2MY8DmkiboibgYBu8JjtHmzZT7ay4wnXRvMFavcNjTVQ0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 存货与预付款大幅增加，为下半年出货备料</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">截至2Q26末，公司存货升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">117亿元</span>，高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>末的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">90亿元</span>和去年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>末的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">72亿元</span>；预付款项从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>末的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.82亿元</span>增至8.69亿元，而去年四季度末仅0.17亿元。存货和预付款同时快速上升，通常意味着公司在为后续交付锁定芯片和物料。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营收<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>归因于三点：AI基础设施<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>带来的客户需求强劲、芯片供给较<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>、硅光产品<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>爬坡以支持1.6T光模块交付。其中硅光是一个值得单独拆开的变量，因为它直接关系到产品组合和毛利率的走向。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看预付款从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.17亿元</span>跳到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.69亿元</span>这个数字，它比存货更能说明供给端的紧张程度。简单说，公司愿意提前付款锁定物料，说明下游订单能见度足够高，也说明上游芯片产能仍不是想拿就能拿。后续更值得观察的是预付款增速何时节奏变化——那可能才是供给约束真正缓解的信号。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVNZH1myiaAoWPTA1pibof14ROCbz5PN33PfHsIicWmSOp6cOicP5Eib0dpI1u0VWO7lEPNWiczvwjY2WuibjxMkhiaDyibODQFvYcqXic4g/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 硅光与EML双路线并行，产品组合决定毛利率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">韧性</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告提到，中际旭创在中国和泰国同时<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>光模块产能，并且具备EML（每通道100G/200G）和硅光两种方案的能力，用以保障800G、1.6T及以上速率产品的生产。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.0%</span>，虽然环比下降1.2个百分点，但同比仍高出1.4个百分点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里的关键不是毛利率的季度波动，而是产品结构。GS在盈利预测调整中基本维持毛利率假设不变，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>毛利率预测分别为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.1%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.3%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48.8%</span>，呈缓步上升态势。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>报告认为，高速产品占比提升带来的产品组合<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，足以抵消竞争加剧可能带来的价格不确定性。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看：1.6T产品的良率和量产进度，直接决定公司能否在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40%</span>以上的净利率。GS预测<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>净利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40.3%</span>，对应净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">320.55亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>。这个增速建立在营收增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">46%</span>的基础上，而营收增长又建立在1.6T产品顺利放量的前提上。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWUJK7P7CzhqsxzENlhXtiapa0ncjOMN7ofZKqgIdgx2Y1e0OrVfuoMQ0H5FPa7DbmhnfhWGocTessRCGM9sut2N8libbJKaSUfc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV5n46aJZicGClF6CKsoSiapSHicsicdLhtbjudiayealiaHnGRpicLIhpLWcxoYktlLtWeta5GBAt7knWJefoP4wFhiaJTkNwVgAkUHGM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 06-GS-Eoptolink -300502-- Sequential QoQ growth ahead on 800G 1.6T optical modules ramp up- 2Q26 Rev better than expected- 报告观点-260825</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
